 "title": "SLC26A4 and ZBTB16 Protein Interactions and Expression",
 "summary": "This cluster is about the interactions and expression of SLC26A4 and ZBTB16 proteins. SLC26A4 is expressed in various organisms, including mouse, stria vascularis, and kidney, and interacts with several proteins, including ZBTB16, CUL3, and AP-2. ZBTB16 is also expressed in mouse and interacts with SLC26A4, CUL3, and EYFP. The two proteins are co-expressed in human and mouse, and SLC26A4 is ubiquitinated by ubiquitin. The interactions between SLC26A4 and ZBTB16 are measured using FRET and Western blot methods.",
